{"id": "17-2992-2-6", "zh": "在过去条件式（kālātipatti）中：ahavissa、ahavissaṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2992-7-9", "zh": "ahuyissatha 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2993-2-21", "zh": "hū、bhū 表示存在；这里的 bhū 带前缀 anu，生成 ti 等词尾后，删去 a 词缀并作强化：anubhoti、anubhonti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2993-22-25", "zh": "anubhosi、anubhotha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2993-26-29", "zh": "anubhomi、anubhoma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-2-6", "zh": "在被动（kamma）中：anubhūyati、anubhūyanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2994-7-11", "zh": "同样：anubhotu、anubhontu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2994-12-15", "zh": "anubhohi、anubhotha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-16-19", "zh": "anubhomi、anubhoma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-20-23", "zh": "anubhūyatu、anubhūyantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-24-27", "zh": "anubhave、anubhaveyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-28-29", "zh": "anubhūyeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-30-33", "zh": "anubhosi、anubhavi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-34-37", "zh": "anubhossati、anubhossanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-38-41", "zh": "anubhossasi、anubhossatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-42-45", "zh": "anubhossāmi、anubhossāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2994-46-48", "zh": "也作 anubhavissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2994-49-54", "zh": "anubhossa，也作 anubhavissa 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2995-2-13", "zh": "sī 表示躺卧；删去 a 词缀，并作强化：seti、senti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2995-14-17", "zh": "sesi、setha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2995-18-21", "zh": "semi、sema。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2995-22-26", "zh": "sete、sente 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2996-2-4", "zh": "不删去 a 词缀时——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2997-2-12", "zh": "“在元音前”一语沿用下来，“词根”一语也沿用下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2998-2-7", "zh": "491. e 变为 aya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2999-2-12", "zh": "词根末尾的 e 音，在后面接元音时，替换为 aya，再作删除元音等处理。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2999-13-16", "zh": "sayati、sayanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2999-17-20", "zh": "sayasi、sayatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2999-21-24", "zh": "sayāmi、sayāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3000-2-22", "zh": "在被动中，带前缀 ati；按照“kvaci dhātu”等规则，在 ya 前面，词根末尾的短元音变为长元音：atisīyate、atisīyante。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3000-23-26", "zh": "atisīyati、atisīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3000-27-29", "zh": "在无人称语态（bhāva）中：sīyate。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3001-2-6", "zh": "同样：setu、sentu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3001-7-10", "zh": "sehi、setha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-11-14", "zh": "semi、sema。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-15-18", "zh": "sayatu、sayantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-19-24", "zh": "saya、sayāhi、sayatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-25-28", "zh": "sayāmi、sayāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-29-32", "zh": "sayataṃ、sayantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-33-36", "zh": "sayassu、sayavho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-37-40", "zh": "saye、sayāmase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-41-44", "zh": "atisīyataṃ、atisīyantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-45-48", "zh": "atisīyatu、atisīyantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3001-49-51", "zh": "在无人称语态中：sīyataṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3002-2-7", "zh": "saye、sayeyya、sayeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3002-8-9", "zh": "atisīyeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3002-10-12", "zh": "在无人称语态中：sīyetha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3003-2-11", "zh": "asayi、sayi、asayiṃsu、sayiṃsu、asayuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3003-12-16", "zh": "加入 s 音时：atisesi、atisesuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3003-17-23", "zh": "在被动中：accasīyittha、accasīyi、atisīyi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3003-24-26", "zh": "在无人称语态中：sīyittha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3004-2-5", "zh": "sayissati、sayissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3004-6-11", "zh": "不加入 i 音时：sessati、sessanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3004-12-16", "zh": "在被动中：atisīyissatha、atisīyissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3004-17-19", "zh": "在无人称语态中：sīyissate。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3005-2-5", "zh": "asayissā、asayissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3005-6-9", "zh": "在被动中：accasīyissatha 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3006-2-13", "zh": "nī 表示引导到达，这是双宾语动词：ajaṃ gāmaṃ neti（他把山羊带到村里）、nenti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3006-14-17", "zh": "nesi、netha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3006-18-21", "zh": "nemi、nema。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3006-22-27", "zh": "不删除时：nayati、nayanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3006-28-37", "zh": "在被动中：nīyate gāmaṃ ajo devadattena（山羊被提婆达多带到村里）、nīyare、nīyante。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3006-38-41", "zh": "nīyati、nīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-2-6", "zh": "同样：netu、nayatu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3007-7-10", "zh": "nīyataṃ、nīyantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-11-14", "zh": "naye、nayeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-15-18", "zh": "nīyetha、nīyeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-19-26", "zh": "anayi、nayi、anayiṃsu、nayiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-27-30", "zh": "vinesi、vinesuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-31-34", "zh": "anīyittha、nīyittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-35-39", "zh": "nayissati、nessati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-40-45", "zh": "nayissate、nīyissate、nīyissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3007-46-50", "zh": "anayissa、anīyissa 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3008-2-12", "zh": "ṭhā 表示停止行走；“vā（或者）”一语沿用下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3009-2-7", "zh": "492. ṭhā 变为 tiṭṭha。", "confidence": 80}
